# The BROWSER service's settings — headless Chromium in a process of its own.
#
# Loaded by docker-compose.lean.yml as the browser service's env_file. The
# service needs NO configuration to serve: it listens on its container port
# (8080, baked into the image) and renders URLs it is handed — in this shape,
# EXPORT__INTERNAL_ORIGIN on the APP names the app's container address. This
# file exists so the compose `env_file` per service has one committed,
# discoverable example.
